  "Arc|aspect|Arc Soul": "Cast your Rift to create an Arc Soul that fires at targets in front of you. Allies can pass through your Rift to get an Arc Soul. Your Rift charges faster when allies are near.\n\nWhile amplified, your Arc Souls are supercharged and gain increased fire rate.\n\nArc Soul damage is scaled by the enhanced benefit of the Grenade stat.",
