  "Arc|aspect|Storm's Keep": "Cast your class ability to grant a moderate amount of Bolt Charge stacks to you and nearby allies.\n\nWhile behind your Barricade, you and allies gain stacks of Bolt Charge over time and your weapons can discharge max stacks of Bolt Charge.",
  "Arc|aspect|Tempest Strike": "While sliding, activate your charged melee ability to unleash a devastating uppercut attack that travels along the ground in front of you, damaging and jolting targets it hits.\n\nDefeating jolted targets grants a stack of Bolt Charge.",
