  "Prismatic|aspect|Diamond Lance": "Shatter or defeat targets with abilities or Stasis Stasis weapons to create a Stasis lance.\n\nShoot: Throw the lance to freeze targets on impact.\n\nMelee: Slam the lance to the ground to freeze targets in a small area.",
