  "Prismatic|super|Nova Bomb: Cataclysm": "Hurl an explosive bolt of Void Light at a target, disintegrating those caught within its blast.\n\nNova Bomb travels slowly and seeks targets. Detonations shatter into smaller seeker projectiles.",
